    <main id="main-content">
        <div class="container" style="min-height:500px">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <div class="page-header text-center my-4">
                <h1>Alta Justice Court</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/twpb-bootstrap.min.css?v=17e66469"><style>.sk-page-content img{max-width:100%;}.sk-page-content h1 a,.sk-page-content h2 a,.sk-page-content h3 a,.sk-page-content h4 a,.sk-page-content h5 a,.sk-page-content h6 a{font:inherit;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]){border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]) td,.sk-page-content table:not([class]) th{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]) th{font-weight:bold;text-align:left;background-color:#f8f9fa;}.column2-2-1723704496671 {padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Textblock-1723704499385 {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Textblock-1723704637571-clone {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Textblock-1723704667165-clone {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Textblock-1723704705199-clone {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.column2-1-1723704496670 {padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.sk-page-content .twpb-photo-wrapper.Photo-1723704590908-wrapper.Photo-1723704590908-wrapper{text-align:center;padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.sk-page-content .twpb-photo.Photo-1723704590908 {width:75%;height:auto;}.Textblock-1723704726968 {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.column1-1723704750301 {padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Html-1723704755758 {padding:50px 50px 50px 50px;margin:50px 50px 50px 50px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.sk-page-content .twpb-photo-wrapper.Photo-1723704866355-wrapper.Photo-1723704866355-wrapper{padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.sk-page-content .twpb-photo.Photo-1723704866355 {width:100%;height:auto;}.Textblock-1723704882155 {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}</style><!--jr:content type=page id=3662--><div class="sk-page-content twpb-row"><div class="twpb-col-12 twpb-col-lg-6 twpb-col-md-6 column2-2-1723704496671 "><div  class="Textblock-1723704499385 "><p style="text-align: center;">Office Hours: Weekdays 10:00 AM &ndash; 4:00 PM <br />Location: in Town Office at 10201 East Hwy 210 in Alta <br />Phone Number: (801) 742-2407 <br />Email: <a href="mailto:mollya@utcourts.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mollya@utcourts.gov</a></p></div><div  class="Textblock-1723704637571-clone "><p style="text-align: center;">To pay fines online go to Utah State Courts website.<br />You will need to enter either your citation # or case # <em>(only enter one)</em>.</p></div><div  class="Textblock-1723704667165-clone "><p style="text-align: center;">The Alta Justice Court sessions are held one Thursday a month at 5:30 PM with Judge Paul Farr presiding.<br />Please call to schedule an appearance at the Alta Justice Court.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><em>Currently, due to the pandemic court is being held virtually via WebEx. Instructions will be sent when you schedule an appearance.</em></p></div><div  class="Textblock-1723704705199-clone "><p style="text-align: center;">Courtroom location: 10351 East Hwy 210, Alta, UT 84092</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Our courtroom is a multi-use room on the second floor of the Alta Post Office building.<br />Access the courtroom through the post office door, and up the stairs to the left of the door.</p></div></div><div class="twpb-col-12 twpb-col-lg-6 twpb-col-md-6 column2-1-1723704496670 "><div class="Photo-1723704590908-wrapper twpb-photo-wrapper"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/130/2024/08/Alta Justice Court .jpg"   alt="" loading="lazy" class="twpb-photo Photo-1723704590908  " /></div><div  class="Textblock-1723704726968 "><p style="text-align: center;"><em>Officers are equipped for extreme conditions and varied terrain.</em></p></div></div><div class="twpb-col-12 twpb-col-lg-12 twpb-col-md-12 column1-1723704750301 "><div  class="Html-1723704755758 "><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d6059.515078806369!2d-111.633723!3d40.591107!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x8752705883dec7cb%3A0x818d1db218593cb6!2s10351%20UT-210%2C%20Alta%2C%20UT%2084092!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1723704767200!5m2!1sen!2sus" width="1100" height="500" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div><div class="Photo-1723704866355-wrapper twpb-photo-wrapper"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/130/2024/08/CourtRoom.jpg"   alt="" loading="lazy" class="twpb-photo Photo-1723704866355  " /></div><div  class="Textblock-1723704882155 "><p style="text-align: center;"><em>To access Courtroom, enter Community Center/ Post Office through door on lookers right side of building and walk up stairs.</em></p></div></div></div><!--/jr:content--><script src="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/twpb-bootstrap.min.js?v=dfb10ed8"></script>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <!--[##widget-page-sidebar]-->
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

